From: AI Browser Control <ai-control@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] Keep AI control colors scoped to individual tabs

Turn externally supplied tab colors into complete per-tab palettes. Each tab
keeps its own normal, hover, selected, foreground and stroke colors without
changing the surrounding tab strip, toolbar, omnibox or profile theme.

---
 chrome/browser/ai_control/ai_control_service.cc       | 22 ++++++
 chrome/browser/ai_control/ai_control_service.h        |  1 +
 chrome/browser/ui/views/tabs/tab_style_views.cc       | 80 ++++++++++++++------
 3 files changed, 79 insertions(+), 21 deletions(-)

diff --git a/chrome/browser/ai_control/ai_control_service.cc b/chrome/browser/ai_control/ai_control_service.cc
--- a/chrome/browser/ai_control/ai_control_service.cc
+++ b/chrome/browser/ai_control/ai_control_service.cc
